{"3529650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Turn Turn Turn Based!", "steam_appid": 3529650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/0f11e468db9269f24717dc7d1cd643ff.poster.avif?t=1782677414\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/0f11e468db9269f24717dc7d1cd643ff.webm?t=1782677414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/0f11e468db9269f24717dc7d1cd643ff.mp4?t=1782677414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique spin on the rogue-lite deck-building card-game genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Turn Turn Turn Based!</strong>, the battlefield changes and evolves. To survive, you must manage your hand and anticipate your enemies next move.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each turn, the <strong>board rotates</strong>, completely changing how the battle may operate. Use specialised<strong> Spin Cards</strong> to manually manipulate the board and turn the tide of the battle in your favour.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/8723ed6f04d32dff97fa99f30b389108.poster.avif?t=1782677414\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/8723ed6f04d32dff97fa99f30b389108.webm?t=1782677414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/8723ed6f04d32dff97fa99f30b389108.mp4?t=1782677414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most cards have a unique <strong>effect</strong>. Cards may only trigger in certain zones or modify other cards on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/a65e600d2af88bebbb55be61ff09d16a.poster.avif?t=1782677414\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/a65e600d2af88bebbb55be61ff09d16a.webm?t=1782677414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/a65e600d2af88bebbb55be61ff09d16a.mp4?t=1782677414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the psychological themes of nostalgia, and unhealthy attachments to the past. The further you play, the more distorted reality becomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the narrative in <strong>Story Mode</strong>, or see how long you can survive the torment in<strong> Endless Mode</strong>.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/0f11e468db9269f24717dc7d1cd643ff.poster.avif?t=1782677414\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/0f11e468db9269f24717dc7d1cd643ff.webm?t=1782677414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/0f11e468db9269f24717dc7d1cd643ff.mp4?t=1782677414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique spin on the rogue-lite deck-building card-game genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Turn Turn Turn Based!</strong>, the battlefield changes and evolves. To survive, you must manage your hand and anticipate your enemies next move.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each turn, the <strong>board rotates</strong>, completely changing how the battle may operate. Use specialised<strong> Spin Cards</strong> to manually manipulate the board and turn the tide of the battle in your favour.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/8723ed6f04d32dff97fa99f30b389108.poster.avif?t=1782677414\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/8723ed6f04d32dff97fa99f30b389108.webm?t=1782677414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/8723ed6f04d32dff97fa99f30b389108.mp4?t=1782677414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most cards have a unique <strong>effect</strong>. Cards may only trigger in certain zones or modify other cards on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/a65e600d2af88bebbb55be61ff09d16a.poster.avif?t=1782677414\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/a65e600d2af88bebbb55be61ff09d16a.webm?t=1782677414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/extras/a65e600d2af88bebbb55be61ff09d16a.mp4?t=1782677414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the psychological themes of nostalgia, and unhealthy attachments to the past. The further you play, the more distorted reality becomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the narrative in <strong>Story Mode</strong>, or see how long you can survive the torment in<strong> Endless Mode</strong>.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A turn-based roguelite deckbuilder with a spinning field. Strategise and plan your next move ahead in this single-player card game where positioning and planning are just as important as the cards in your hand.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/b3ded384518c8f1abc5e790ff6d501c0bc89e4bf/header.jpg?t=1782677414", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/e6d335196166eaa49e1fbcd3a1a565f9343497ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782677414", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529650/e6d335196166eaa49e1fbcd3a1a565f9343497ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782677414", "website": "https://greycatgames.com/?utm_source=steam&amp;utm_medium=store", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any Dual-core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any GPU supporting OpenGL 3.x / DX10+<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</str